National weighted civil filings per judgeship were **554 (JB‑2020)** in FY 2020 and **318           
(JFF‑2024)** in FY 2021.                                                                            
                                                                                                    
* FY 2020: 554 (JB‑2020) – first published as 554 (JB‑2020) and later revised to 322 (JFF‑2025)     
【...】                                                                                             
* FY 2021: 318 (JFF‑2024) – first published as 434 (JB‑2021) and later revised to 318 (JFF‑2024)    
【...】                                                                                             
                                                                                                    
**Citations**                                                                                       
                                                                                                    
| Fiscal year | Edition | Value |                                                                   
|-------------|---------|-------|                                                                   
| 2020 | JB‑2020 (first published) | 554 |                                                          
| 2021 | JFF‑2024 (latest) | 318 |                                                                  
                                                                                                    
